    "plain_text": "Paul Coulson is an Irish financier who transformed a single Dublin glass plant into Ardagh Group, a global glass and metal packaging manufacturer. Trained as an accountant, he first built aircraft-leasing and investment group Yeoman International. He expanded Ardagh through debt-funded acquisitions before relinquishing control to creditors in a 2025 restructuring.",
